<title>USA: Intel Corp Q4 shr rises to $2.13.</title>
<headline>Intel Corp Q4 shr rises to $2.13.</headline>
<text>
<p>SANTA CLARA, Calif., Jan 14 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			Dec. 28, 1996     Q4    Dec. 30, 1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.13		    $0.98</p>
<p> Net		    1,910,000		  867,000</p>
<p> Revs		   6,440,000		4,580,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 897,000		  887,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>					   YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $5.81		    $4.03</p>
<p> Net		    5,157,000		3,566,000</p>
<p> Revs		  20,847,000	     16,202,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 888,000		  884,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call estimate for the fourth quarter is $1.84. Q4 '96 gross margin was 63 pct vs 48 pct in Q4 '95. Net cash at the end of Q4 '96 was $8.2 bln vs $3.4 bln at end of Q4 '95.</p>
